Shamash is a collection of six smaller planetoids connected by pliant bridges of light blue thread. While the thread appears weak from a distance, it does overcome the pull of the planets to keep them bonded, and must have great tensile strength.

:::fields
Color :: Effects from Shamash have the color of garnet.
Aspects :: Ancestry: generational knowledge, social structure, and patronage.
Manifestation :: Manifestations of Shamash can draw upon otherworldly powers, manipulate physical forms, and replicate the abilities of others.
Conjunction :: Ghosts, spirits, and other incorporeal entities are more likely to be produced. In addition, pacts with extraplanar patrons and powerful devils are easier to find and make.
Opposition :: Communing with the dead is more difficult and tension is exerted against patriarchal and matriarchal power structures.
:::
